id: pm-starter-toolchain-1104
title: Migrate PR187 to the November 4 pm toolchain
description: "Update exact toolchain pins and migrate native paginated-consumer fixtures for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/pull/187 and issue #190."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[5]: dependencies,"gh:unbraind/pm-starter#187","gh:unbraind/pm-starter#190",migration,sdk
