updated_at: "2026-11-04T21:01:33.056Z"
author: codex-toolchain-1104
acceptance_criteria: All eight genuine native consumer tests pass with six formerly sentinel-valued fields absent; complete coverage remains 100 percent without reduced thresholds; record each root cause and gate result.
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-04T19:16:18.545Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Test: verified issue #190 on pm-cli 2026.11.4. test/paginated-consumer.test.ts reports 1/9 passing; its eight native-consumer cases fail during setup because GH-1614 (2026.10.30) rejects typed parent:none. Replace all six intended empty fields with unset:[parent,goal,objective,sprint,release,assignee] and assert each create result has those fields absent. Preserve every pagination/cancellation/snapshot/native-read assertion; no production consumer change."
  "2026-11-04T19:17:17.381Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"The first repaired run exposed two additional sentinel-generating creates in the same file: peer snapshot mutation and between-read/write transition fixtures. Migrate those and scripts/validate-consumer-pack.ts too. The snapshot test reached its intended continuation assertions before the remaining peer-create sentinel failed; this is the same GH-1614 test migration, not evidence of a consumer runtime regression."
  "2026-11-04T19:26:07.326Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Final-fixture verification: linked pm test selects native snapshot and peer snapshot cases and passes 2/2 (38.9 seconds), with genuine SDK continuation/refusal behavior. The diagnostic file run passed its other seven cases, including the permanent 500-sequence model and installed JSON/TOON CLI acceptance; its two stale-module failures were both the additional sentinel creates now repaired. Typecheck, build:test, docstrings, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), pack dry-run, changelog and publish-attestation gates pass. Full coverage is queued behind earlier PRs."
  "2026-11-04T19:39:57.098Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Secondary pin audit: refresh tracked bun.lock, which still resolved CLI/ops/changelog 2026.10.4 and an older peer floor. bun install --lockfile-only --ignore-scripts resolves the declared exact CLI/ops 2026.11.4 and changelog 2026.10.31, with the existing minimum >=2026.8.18 retained. No executable SDK installation changed during lockfile regeneration."
  "2026-11-04T21:01:32.231Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Final full gate PASS: nice -n 10 env NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null npm run coverage reports 217 tests passed, 0 failed/cancelled/skipped; 100.00 percent lines, branches and functions across all 7 configured source files, with the source-presence check passing. All nine paginated-consumer cases execute successfully on the final fixture. Typecheck, build/test compilation, docstrings, audit (0 vulnerabilities), pack dry-run, changelog and attestation checks passed. Tracked dist was rebuilt with no diff. Regenerated bun.lock matches the declared CLI/ops 2026.11.4 and changelog 2026.10.31 and validates with frozen lockfile-only resolution. No production consumer defect or new upstream defect established."
